spice
*MOSFET Differential Pair Netlist
*PMOS Transistor
M2 2 5 4 4 PMOS

*NMOS Transistor
M1 2 5 3 3 NMOS

*Voltage Source
VDD 4 0 DC 5V

*Input Voltage
Vin 5 0 DC 0V

*.model parameters (example values)
.model PMOS PMOS (LEVEL=1 KP=30u VTO=-0.7)
.model NMOS NMOS (LEVEL=1 KP=50u VTO=1)

*Simulation Commands
*.op
*.end